        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/898d66/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-27T02:30:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I have an idea for an enviroment and I thought I would share it. &nbsp;</p><p>SotM is normally a challenge for four characters (at least so far for me). &nbsp;I can not imagine winning it with only three players. &nbsp;However sometimes I think it would be nice to play with only three people. &nbsp;So this led me to think that there could be a Hero's base enviroment that would be geared to helping the heros so that you could fight the villian with only two characters.</p><p><span>Just an Idea.</span></p><p>Matt</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:18.082Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
